<title>USA: TENNIS-LOS ANGELES OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LOS ANGELES OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the $303,000</p>
<p>Infiniti Open men's tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>2-Thomas Endqvist (Sweden) beat Vincent Spadea (U.S.) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 6-1</p>
<p>3-Mark Philippoussis (Australia) beat Sandon Stolle</p>
<p>(Australia) 3-6 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Guillaume Raoux (France) beat 5-Patrick Rafter (Australia)</p>
<p>6-4 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) beat Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) 6-4</p>
<p>3-6 6-3</p>
</text>
